macOS (launchd)Linux (systemd)Docker <p>If installed via script, use the helper commands:</p> <pre><code>~/.cast2md/stop      # Stop the node
~/.cast2md/start     # Start the node
~/.cast2md/restart   # Restart the node
~/.cast2md/logs      # Follow the log file
</code></pre> <p>For manual setup, create <code>~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.cast2md.node.plist</code>:</p> <pre><code>&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?&gt;
&lt;!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd"&gt;
&lt;plist version="1.0"&gt;
&lt;dict&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;Label&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;string&gt;com.cast2md.node&lt;/string&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;ProgramArguments&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;array&gt;
        &lt;string&gt;/path/to/venv/bin/cast2md&lt;/string&gt;
        &lt;string&gt;node&lt;/string&gt;
        &lt;string&gt;start&lt;/string&gt;
        &lt;string&gt;--no-browser&lt;/string&gt;
    &lt;/array&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;WorkingDirectory&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;string&gt;/path/to/cast2md&lt;/string&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;RunAtLoad&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;true/&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;KeepAlive&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;true/&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;StandardOutPath&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;string&gt;~/.cast2md/node.log&lt;/string&gt;
    &lt;key&gt;StandardErrorPath&lt;/key&gt;
    &lt;string&gt;~/.cast2md/node.log&lt;/string&gt;
&lt;/dict&gt;
&lt;/plist&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Load:</p> <pre><code>launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.cast2md.node.plist
</code></pre> <p>If installed via script:</p> <pre><code>systemctl --user stop cast2md-node
systemctl --user start cast2md-node
systemctl --user restart cast2md-node
systemctl --user status cast2md-node
</code></pre> <p>Log file: <code>~/.cast2md/node.log</code></p> <p>For manual setup, create <code>~/.config/systemd/user/cast2md-node.service</code>:</p> <pre><code>[Unit]
Description=cast2md Transcriber Node
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
WorkingDirectory=/path/to/cast2md
ExecStart=/path/to/venv/bin/cast2md node start --no-browser
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
Environment=WHISPER_MODEL=large-v3-turbo
Environment=WHISPER_BACKEND=faster-whisper

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
</code></pre> <p>Enable and start:</p> <pre><code>systemctl --user daemon-reload
systemctl --user enable cast2md-node
systemctl --user start cast2md-node
</code></pre> <pre><code>FROM python:3.11-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY . .
RUN pip install -e .
COPY node.json /root/.cast2md/node.json
CMD ["cast2md", "node", "start"]
</code></pre> <pre><code>docker build -f Dockerfile.node -t cast2md-node .
docker run -d --name cast2md-node \
  -v ~/.cast2md:/root/.cast2md \
  -e WHISPER_MODEL=base \
  cast2md-node
</code></pre>
